# API base URL used by the FarmIQ frontend.
# Web dev (`npm run dev`) falls back to http://127.0.0.1:8001 when this is unset.
# (Port 8000 is often occupied on Windows; 8001 is the project default.)
#
# For the Capacitor Android build, set this to a URL the device can reach.
# 127.0.0.1 will NOT work on a device (it points at the device itself).
#
#   Browser dev:       VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001  (default fallback)
#   Android emulator:  VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8001
#   Physical device:   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.x.x:8001  (your LAN IP)
#   Production:        VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://farmiq-api-hpss.onrender.com
#
# Build with it (PowerShell):
#   $env:VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://10.0.2.2:8001"; npm run build
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
